# Ryoku packages whose PKGBUILD says arch=('x86_64') only because Ryoku ships
# x86_64, but which build from source on aarch64 unchanged. Built with
# `makepkg --ignorearch`; the result is a native aarch64 package.

# Go + cgo build from a pinned commit (no x86 binaries, no x86 flags). Ryoku
# Rashin's code index and agent skills need it (the doctor's "prowl for rashin").
prowl-agent
